# consistent with the 2d801d1/802352b inference that the 0x24d0 handler does not run the fixture's bias. It is
# not a witness: a byte can be read without changing these outputs.
# 0x7B (reported, not predicted) is insensitive under both masks. T3 is out of scope here (it needs the full
# region).
# Post hoc, NOT pre-registered (both consistent with earlier findings, neither a test):
